  "instance_name": "holocaust_minimization_theme",
  "label": "Holocaust Minimization Theme",
  "description": "The meme's text 'anne frankly i don't care' is a deliberate mockery of Anne Frank's diary, which documents the harrowing experiences of Jewish people during the Holocaust. The phrase 'anne frankly' is a pun on her name, and 'i don't care' implies indifference to the genocide she witnessed and survived. This theme relies on the real-world historical context of the Holocaust and the moral gravity of the event to create its provocative and hateful message. It is a form of Holocaust denial/minimization, which is a well-documented antisemitic trope.",
